.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class SPLITBOUNDARY_COMPLEX>
.br
class csmp::SplitBoundaryInterface< dim, SPLITBOUNDARY_COMPLEX >"Creation, management and deletion of \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects\&.

.PP
Split boundaries can be created for:
.IP "1." 4
internal model boundaries
.IP "2." 4
node-matched disconnected boundaries of the mesh 
.PP

.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
