.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class SPLITBOUNDARY_COMPLEX> set< string > \fBcsmp::SplitBoundaryInterface\fP< dim, SPLITBOUNDARY_COMPLEX >::InsertLowerDimensionalRegionsIntoSplitBoundaries (int32_t material_id)"

.PP
Creates isolated lower-dimensional mesh regions between split boundaries with unique names matching those of the \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects; set will be empty if none created\&. Insert a lower-dimensional element mesh into the model, which is fully disconnected from the model, to represent a fracture that coincides with a \fBSplitBoundary\fP according to the desire to use \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects for lower-dimensional fractures for the modelling of both, fluid flow and geomechanics\&. It only shares the locations of the nodes (if the \fBSplitBoundary\fP has not been modified) or lies in the symmetry plane of the 2 sides if the nodes have been separated by deformation\&.

.PP
