.SS "template<uint32_t dim, template< uint32_t > class SPLITBOUNDARY_COMPLEX> size_t \fBcsmp::SplitBoundaryInterface\fP< dim, SPLITBOUNDARY_COMPLEX >::SeparateUniqueRegionsBySplitBoundaries ()"

.PP
creates consistently named split boundaries between all unique regions in the model Form consistently named split boundaries between all the unique regions in the current model, while detecting and honouring already existing \fBBoundary\fP and \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects identified by INTERNAL boundary flags\&. These lower-dimensional model subdomains will not be touched\&. Only those unique regions are considered which have the same spatial dimension as the model\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
all perimeter nodes / contact points between split boundaries in 2D will become NodeManifolds connecting as many \fBNode\fP objects as regions are in contact with one another at that split boundary\&. 
.RE
.PP

